  "description": "Featuring the new Shimano Cues drop bar, hydraulic groupset, sliding dropouts and all the tire clearance and braze-on options that the Bombtrack Arise is known and loved for, the Arise SG Cues breathes a whole new layer of versatility into our lineup. The 11 - 48T wide range 10 speed cassette provides that get out of jail gear for when things get steep on the weeklong bike tour, but the one by chainset means there is one less thing to clog up with grime during those winter commuting months. The Arise chassis is a blank canvas onto which any adventurer can build up a bike for all scenarios. Ready for internal dynamo cable routing but equipped with external shift and brake hose routing for easy field and home servicing, the Arise SG Cues might just be your next forever bike.",
